emFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动Seedance2.5视频生成模型将于7月16日全量开放API</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI全量开放GPT-5.6系列模型，推出三档定价并刷新编程智能体性能纪录</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta 发布旗舰模型 Muse Spark 1.1，升级多代理自动化与上下文压缩技术</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布LiteRT.js加速库，利用WebAssembly与WebGPU实现浏览器AI推理提速3倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/06124e81b4c0aa159880ffd9eabfb1ec.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布全新Web端AI推理加速库LiteRT.js，旨在替代TensorFlow.js的传统JavaScript内核方案。该库核心采用WebAssembly二进制指令格式，并深度集成WebGPU与WebNN硬件加速能力，显著提升浏览器端机器学习工作负载的执行效率。在搭载M4芯片的2024款MacBook Pro实测中，LiteRT.js的推理速度较现有方案最高提升3倍。此次架构升级标志着谷歌推动Web端AI从纯JavaScript向高性能硬件加速阶段演进，使浏览器运行AI模型的性能逼近原生应用水平。对于开发者而言，LiteRT.js不仅优化了端侧AI的部署体验，还降低了复杂AI功能在Web端的运行门槛，无需安装客户端即可实现流畅的AI交互，将加速端侧AI在网页端的普及与应用落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯拟接盘AI初创公司Manus成为最大股东，估值达20亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97ef792120e26c5284778ab38c44f9d0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯控股正洽谈成为新加坡AI初创公司Manus的最大股东，旨在撤销Meta此前达成的超20亿美元收购案。该交易计划以20亿美元估值进行，腾讯将认购最多股份，Benchmark等美国风投机构预计退出。Manus由肖弘、季逸超和张涛于2022年创立，作为AI Agent领域的明星项目，其年度经常性收入（ARR）已接近5亿美元。交易完成后，Manus将保持独立运营并寻求在香港上市。此次增持将加速腾讯微信嵌入式AI智能体的应用落地，深化其在AGI时代的底层生态布局。此前，腾讯已邀请Manus创始人肖弘参与微信AI智能体的测试。该举措标志着腾讯在AI Agent赛道进一步强化技术与业务协同，通过资本运作巩固其在智能体生态的战略地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动Seedance2.5视频生成模型将于7月16日全量开放API</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d8a99773646ec407ef9c7515421df4da.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动旗下视频生成模型Seedance2.5将于7月16日正式全量开放API，标志着该模型从灰度测试阶段迈向全面商用。Seedance2.5于6月23日发布，目前AI创作平台“即梦”已开启上线预热，并计划配套推出会员折扣与积分优惠。技术层面，该模型实现三大突破：支持30秒单段原生视频直出，大幅提升连贯性；多模态参考容量提升至50个全模态素材，增强上下文理解；引入高可控性视频编辑功能，支持对画面主体和运镜的精准微调。行业预计其定价将与2.0版本持平。此次全量商用将加速AI视频技术在影视创意与商业广告领域的工程化落地，进一步降低高品质视频生成的门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI全量开放GPT-5.6系列模型，推出三档定价并刷新编程智能体性能纪录</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9c493c4636b6ed89435c6afaf53b4e36.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式向全球全量开放GPT-5.6系列模型，包含旗舰版Sol、均衡版Terra和性价比版Luna，并于24小时内覆盖ChatGPT、Codex及API。定价策略极具竞争力，每百万Token输入/输出价格分别为5/30美元、2.5/15美元及1/6美元。性能方面，Sol在Agents&#x27; Last Exam评测中以53.6分超越Claude Fable5，并在Artificial Analysis编程智能体指数中以80分刷新纪录。该系列引入ultra模式，支持最多16个智能体并行，在BrowseComp测试中达92.2%，ExploitBench得分提升至73.5%。尽管在SWE-Bench Pro及FrontierMath等深度工程与前沿数学领域仍落后于Anthropic的Fable5，但GPT-5.6</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta 发布旗舰模型 Muse Spark 1.1，升级多代理自动化与上下文压缩技术</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ab4da36137c14965b56ec16876692b7a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta 正式发布旗舰模型 Muse Spark 1.1，重点优化多代理自动化工作流程，现已通过 Meta AI 及 API 开放公众预览。该模型支持 100 万标记的上下文窗口，并引入上下文压缩机制，能有效保存关键细节以实现子任务间的数据传递。在多代理架构中，主代理负责制定计划，子代理执行操作，Muse Spark 1.1 可实时检测执行变化并动态调整计划。性能方面，该模型在 Vibe Code Bench v1.1 基准测试中取得 72.2 分，较前代旗舰提升超 50 分，在 SWE-Atlas Codebase QnA 测试中得分提升近 18%。其在编码任务中表现突出，能自动识别技术问题并修复代码，同时支持电商描述生成、餐厅下单等多步骤任务。Meta 计划明年将数据中心容量提升至 14 千兆瓦，并有望推出</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
